# Sebocyte LC–MS Lipidomics Analysis Workflow

This notebook contains a cleaned, reproducible Python workflow for LC–MS lipidomics data exported from Compound Discoverer. It includes peak-rating-based feature filtering, normalization, PCA, heatmap visualization, volcano plots, and lipid-class-level comparison.

## Experimental groups
- Control sebocytes
- Exo1: low-dose MSC-derived exosome treatment
- Exo5: high-dose MSC-derived exosome treatment
- MSC: MSC co-culture

## Expected input
The input CSV should contain: `Name`, `m/z`, `RT [min]`, biological sample peak-area columns, and peak-rating columns for individual raw files.

